like decimal numbers,

1501
01:12:28,490 --> 01:12:31,460
float the numbers,
extra tokens, we

1502
01:12:31,460 --> 01:12:34,580
find that just using
numbers or actual tokens

1503
01:12:34,580 --> 01:12:36,460
would be good enough.

1504
01:12:36,460 --> 01:12:37,940
Yes.

1505
01:12:37,940 --> 01:12:40,550
Yes.

1506
01:12:40,550 --> 01:12:58,040
[INAUDIBLE] three different
[INAUDIBLE] more promising.

1507
01:12:58,040 --> 01:13:02,070
Yeah, I think both directions
are worth exploring.

1508
01:13:02,070 --> 01:13:05,585
There are different
advantages of generating--

1509
01:13:05,585 --> 01:13:07,470
