directly, I think

1510
01:13:07,470 --> 01:13:12,380
it borrows the autoregressive
nature of language modeling.

1511
01:13:12,380 --> 01:13:15,230
And it aligns with a
lot of other tasks,

1512
01:13:15,230 --> 01:13:18,320
