of traditional robotics,

1519
01:13:35,060 --> 01:13:38,490
this optimization based or
model predictor control.

1520
01:13:38,490 --> 01:13:45,200
And you can also take into,
let's say, safety constraints

1521
01:13:45,200 --> 01:13:46,200
more easily.

1522
01:13:46,200 --> 01:13:48,420
It can generate more
diverse actions.

1523
01:13:48,420 --> 01:13:51,770
Maybe one recipe is to
generate a lot of data

1524
01:13:51,770 --> 01:13:54,620
with the language to reward
system and distill them

1525
01:13:54,620 --> 01:13:57,560
