I don't know how scalable it is.

1529
01:14:06,770 --> 01:14:08,810
We're not fine tuning
the language model,

1530
01:14:08,810 --> 01:14:12,095
so maybe you are
limited to what--

1531
01:14:12,095 --> 01:14:14,720
you are at the mercy of the
