what moonwalk is.

1535
01:14:20,120 --> 01:14:23,880
It roughly knows how to do that.

1536
01:14:23,880 --> 01:14:26,600
But if you want to scale
to completely new things,

1537
01:14:26,600 --> 01:14:28,430
maybe you can use the
language to reward

1538
01:14:28,430 --> 01:14:30,800
to bootstrap your
data generation,

1539
01:14:30,800 --> 01:14:33,280
